{
 "_doc": "Tier-2 pool building (random towns, industrial lots): the town's pumping station and treatment plant. Route: the street door is bolted -> round the east side: a workshop window smashed in (jaws under it) -> the workshop -> the hall -> the lab: the stores key on its hook (taking it wakes the pump hall: ambush) -> the pump hall, two storeys of pumps (cans strung across its door) -> down the stair to the valve gallery: two of the crew wake when you step in -> the emergency stores (the operator's alarm in one dressing): Gus guards the water and the tablets -> back up and out through the hall, unbolting the street door. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
