   "author": "Hollowmere team",
   "population": "loggers",
   "story": "Gus Lindqvist ran the town's water for thirty-one years and he kept it running through the Bloom: when the Cordon said boil all water, Gus doubled the chlorine; when the crew started coughing, he sent them home and kept the pumps on himself. The last of them came back anyway, to the only place in town with clean water, and Gus let them into the pump hall. He kept the emergency stores in the valve gallery under lock and the key on the lab hook, because the stores were for the town, not for whoever got there first.",
